1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,530
(Penny:)Question one.

2
00:00:01,528 --> 00:00:03,528
"Given the choice

3
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:05,060
"of anyone in the world,
whom would you want

4
00:00:05,065 --> 00:00:06,765
as a dinner guest?"

5
00:00:06,766 --> 00:00:08,096
(Leonard:)Hmm.

6
00:00:08,101 --> 00:00:09,301
(Sheldon:)Living or dead?

7
00:00:09,302 --> 00:00:11,232
Just says "anyone in the world."

8
00:00:11,237 --> 00:00:12,437
(Penny:)I guess that means living.

9
00:00:12,439 --> 00:00:13,639
(Sheldon:)Ah, that's just as well.

10
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,710
(Sheldon:)As much as I'd love
to meet Euclid--

11
00:00:15,709 --> 00:00:17,379
(Sheldon:)inventor of the
geometric proof--

12
00:00:17,377 --> 00:00:18,977
(Sheldon:)he probably wore
sandals and I cannot

13
00:00:18,978 --> 00:00:21,248
(Sheldon:)look at toes during dinner.

14
00:00:22,982 --> 00:00:24,652
Oh, I know!

15
00:00:24,651 --> 00:00:26,381
(Sheldon:)The person I'd most
like to have dinner with

16
00:00:26,386 --> 00:00:29,686
(Sheldon:)is myself.

17
00:00:29,689 --> 00:00:31,089
(Penny:)You sure that's your choice?

18
00:00:31,091 --> 00:00:33,361
'Cause I've had that dinner.

19
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,930
(Sheldon:)Well, I haven't.

20
00:00:34,928 --> 00:00:36,728
(Sheldon:)And while they say
never meet your heroes,

21
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,700
(Sheldon:)I just don't see how
I could disappoint.

22
00:00:38,698 --> 00:00:40,968
(Sheldon:)Who would you choose?

23
00:00:40,967 --> 00:00:43,097
(Penny:)Robert Downey, Jr.
You...

24
00:00:43,103 --> 00:00:44,273
Oh!

25
00:00:44,270 --> 00:00:47,170
(Sheldon:)I didn't think of Iron Man.

26
00:00:48,441 --> 00:00:50,411
(Sheldon:)You know, maybe after
myself and I have dinner,

27
00:00:50,410 --> 00:00:52,680
(Sheldon:)we can meet you two for dessert.

28
00:00:55,281 --> 00:00:57,451
(Raj:)So, what do you
guys want to do?

29
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,480
(Amy:)Well, we're the ones
tagging along, you pick.

